      "preview": "Three useful answers before you decide.",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Hi there,",
        "Three useful questions before you decide:",
        "Is it a diet? It is built around the 4-Part Meal Method and one small action a day, with no extreme diet or detox program.",
        "Will it take over my life? It is designed to be practical: one action a day for 30 days.",
        "Is it medical advice? No. If you have a health condition or take medication, check with an appropriate health professional before making changes that could affect your care or adding supplements.",
        "Who is it not for? Anyone looking for a quick fix. This is a steady 30-day routine.",
        "$9.99, one time. No subscription."
      ],
      "cta": "See the full Reset",
      "url": "https://fitnessworld.pro/the-30-day-natural-wellness-reset/?utm_source=resend&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=reset_welcome_v1&utm_content=day_6",
      "templateId": "1bb08d01-b10d-476d-8e0d-1d3930383d28"
