      "day": 9,
      "subject": "Your last note in the Reset welcome series",
      "preview": "A short invitation, with no pressure.",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Hi there,",
        "This is the last email in your Reset welcome series.",
        "The full 30-Day Natural Wellness Reset is $9.99, one time.",
        "If it is not for you right now, that is fine. Your free preview is yours to keep. If you have a question, just reply.",
